Subject: [PATCH 1455/3799] soh: rename func_808ACC34 ->
 BgSpot02Objects_LightningUpdate

Name source: DEDUCED from the code (confidence HIGH) -- zeldaret/oot
leaves this symbol address-named too, so there is no upstream name to adopt.
Reason: the params 3 variant: steps the lightning frame counter while the cutscene cue is active, kills itself after twelve frames, and plays the thunder sfx on two fixed cutscene frames.
Defined in soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Bg_Spot02_Objects/z_bg_spot02_objects.c.

Tagged [LLM:HIGH] at the definition, every declaration and every call site, so a
reader meeting the name anywhere knows it is inferred.
